@startuml
!theme plain
title Long-Running Accounting Report — Source-Based Sequence
actor Accountant
participant "accounting-ui" as UI
participant "accounting-report-service" as Reports
database "Report Artifact Store" as Store
Accountant -> UI : Generate report
UI -> Reports : /getReport
Reports -> Reports : Start asynchronous job
Reports --> UI : queueId
loop Every 30 seconds, max 10 minutes
 UI -> Reports : /checkReport(queueId)
 alt Job still running
   Reports --> UI : PENDING
 else Job ready
   Reports -> Store : Persist generated artifact
   Reports --> UI : READY + report reference
   UI --> Accountant : Download report
 end
end
opt No READY by 10-minute deadline
 UI --> Accountant : Show generation-timeout error
end
note bottom of Reports
Source exercise omits authorization
and unrelated exceptions.
end note
@enduml